closing tag that showed in the downloaded Markdown.

v4.17.16 — 2026-10-26

Reading guides speak one language at a time: lines whose English half opens with an event number ("… / 9005: the science
ship …") and bilingual bold item titles are now split, so the English page no longer shows the Chinese half beside it and the
