v4.7.0 — 2026-10-18

Calmer, quicker, sturdier. Continue cards show the picture of the document they lead to; a specimen opened from a
chapter returns you to that chapter when you close the Grand Archive, and its "From the story" link opens the document
that awards it. Gameplay effects read more plainly (no repeated chances or script weights, no default targets), guides
keep their editor notes folded away at the end, and the reader and search drop labels that only stated the obvious.
Fixes: closing while a story is still downloading now cancels it; the browser's Back closes a story instead of leaving
the site; landscape phones can reach the open button; English effect lines no longer lose their resource name; network
and audio failures say so in the page's language. Slow connections and phones load far less before the covers appear
(emulated phone: covers ready in about half the time), and music there starts on the first tap.
